  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp increases in marine insurance costs raise trade and energy prices and prompt governments and commercial stakeholders to apply diplomatic pressure on parties in the Israel–Gaza–Lebanon arena to restrain escalation and protect chokepoints and supply lines.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
</edge>
