  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in war/political risk premiums raise the cost and reduce the expected returns of cross‑border tech investments and transactions, prompting investors and acquirers to scale back or delay capital flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
