  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher proportionate deployment of counter‑drone detection and interdiction systems on ships, at chokepoints and ports demonstrably reduces successful attacks and near‑miss incidents, leading insurers to reassess and lower war/political risk surcharges for transits.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
