<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_capital_flo" target="russia_ukraine_war::interceptor_stocks" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increases in cross-border capital flows (private donors, emergency credits, cross‑border procurement financing) enable faster purchases and replenishment of interceptor missiles and related munitions for Ukraine and its partners, directly raising interceptor inventories.</data>
