  <data key="d37">Rising regulatory uncertainty in the US–China tech arena disrupts commercial intelligence‑sharing agreements and joint technical platforms used by US/ROK/Japan forces, degrading situational awareness and increasing the chance of inadvertent or miscalculated cross‑border incidents.</data>
