<edge source="israel_gaza_lebanon::military_kinetic_intensi" target="north_korea_threat::military_escalation" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high-intensity kinetic fighting in Israel diverts US and allied operational assets and attention away from the Indo‑Pacific, which North Korean leadership can perceive as a window to conduct missile tests or limited provocations that raise overall military escalation on the peninsula.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">north_korea_threat</data>
</edge>
<edge source="israel_gaza_lebanon::military_kinetic_intensi" target="russia_ukraine_war::drone_attack_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in kinetic operations in Israel–Gaza increases battlefield demand for and combat-proven use of loitering munitions and small armed drones, prompting manufacturers and brokers to ramp up production and exports that raise the availability of such drones to actors operating against Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="israel_gaza_lebanon::military_kinetic_intensi" target="strait_hormuz_standoff::maritime_attack_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A sharp rise in kinetic operations in Israel–Gaza/Lebanon increases incentives for Iran and allied proxies to conduct asymmetric retaliation or pressure operations at sea, producing more interdictions, missile/drone strikes and harassment of commercial vessels in the Hormuz passage.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
</edge>
