  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Cross-border attacks that damage ports, transport routes, or regional logistics hubs delay or disrupt shipments of semiconductors and other critical components transiting the region, reducing short‑term availability for technology manufacturers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
