  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating diplomatic demands from external states for protection of energy flows after the Israel–Gaza/Lebanon crisis prompt formation or endorsement of centralized multinational convoy/escort arrangements, concentrating authority over vessel movements through the Strait.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
</edge>
