  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Intense diplomatic campaigning and demands among allies over crisis-related alignments signal potential coordinated sanctions or export policy shifts, raising firms' uncertainty about near‑term US and allied regulatory actions toward China-related tech activities.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
