  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Deeper engagement by major powers in the Middle East causes redeployment of mobile counter‑drone sensors, EW teams and training rotations to protect forces and bases there, reducing the pace of deliveries and deployments that would expand counter‑drone coverage in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
