  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">If major powers (notably the US and EU) divert high-level diplomatic bandwidth and leverage to managing the Israel–Gaza/Lebanon crisis, their capacity and political will to broker or sustain negotiations over Strait of Hormuz transit arrangements falls, slowing progress.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_gaza_lebanon</data>
  <data key="d40">strait_hormuz_standoff</data>
