  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened involvement by the US and other major powers in the Israel–Gaza–Lebanon crisis prompts rapid security reviews and coordinated policy responses that translate into immediate tightening and expansion of export controls on sensitive technologies to China.</data>
