  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Discrete cross‑border strikes, airspace violations, or sabotage near ports and logistics hubs disrupt shipment routes and supply chains for semiconductors and other tech components, reducing short‑term availability.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">north_korea_threat</data>
